      "future_sbc": "Core GAAP-like EBIT includes compensation cost. Allocation requires an explicit expense schedule for existing June unvested awards already included in that EBIT and removes only that schedule after tax before valuing those existing awards separately. Future-grant cash replacement excludes the removed existing-award expense. No broad SBC addback; no terminal existing-award addback. Allocation additionally enforces the remaining-expense total and recognition horizon, source-context admission limit under the no-positive-additions convention, and explicit retained compensation/other-cash-cost envelopes.",
